{title: Mere Iraaday}
{artist: Abdul Hannan}
{key: B}

{c: Verse 1}
[B] Kaisay [F#] kahu mai tumsa [D#m] koi,        [C#] Koi na hai
[B] Mai tere [F#] aas paas [D#m] rahu,        [C#] Dil veeraan hai
[B] Jaz [F#] baat mere [D#m] sabhi,        [C#] Tu hi jaanay
[B] Jithna [F#] bhi dekhu [D#m] tumhe,        [C#] Dil bhar na paaye
[B] Kaisa [F#] sama hai,        [D#m] Hum tum [C#] yahan hain
[B] Zaahir [F#] karu kya hain jo,        [D#m] Mere [C#] iraaday
[B] Tere [F#] hawaalay mai,        [D#m] Kisi [C#] bahaanay
[B] Zaahir [F#] karu kiya hain jo,        [D#m] Mere [C#] iraaday
[D#m] Mere, mere [B] iraaday,        [B] Aesay yun [F#] gungunaata [D#m] rahu
[C#] Tere liye mai,        [B] Chaahun [F#] kay mujh tak [D#m] rahein
[C#] Teri nigaahein,        [B] Kaisay mai kahu
[F#] Kaisay mai ye kahu,        [D#m] Asar jo tera mere
[C#] Dil pe huwa hai,        [B] Kaisa [F#] sama hai
[D#m] Hum tum [C#] yahan hain,        [B] Dil ki [F#] pukaar to
[D#m] Sun le [C#] na,        [B] Tere [F#] hawaalay mai
[D#m] Kisi [C#] bahaanay,        [B] Zaahir [F#] karu kiya hain jo
[D#m] Mere [C#] iraaday,        [D#m] Mere, mere [B] iraaday
